1
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:15,520
You are

2
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:17,539
weak right now.

3
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:18,640
So,

4
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,760
you want to kill me while you can.

5
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,920
As long as I kill you,

6
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:26,039
my brothers and I will be free.

7
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,039
Just based on that,

8
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,160
you want to kill me?

9
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,360
Better than you, Capital Director.

10
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:34,520
Schemed against by a despicable villain.

11
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:36,240
Do you think I'm afraid of you?

12
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:39,039
You are still provoking me at this time.

13
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:41,400
What a nerve you have.

14
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,080
I have no need to be afraid of you.

15
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,280
Let me ask you,

16
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:47,560
normally,

17
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,520
have I

18
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,570
held a deep grudge against you?

19
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:52,170
Let me ask you again,

20
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,890
have I ever mistreated you?

21
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,840
I killed and burned before,

22
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:59,200
just so my dog brothers and I could survive.

23
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:04,360
But since entering the Ice Well Agency,

24
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,890
though we lost our freedom,

25
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,560
at least they have a home.

26
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,280
If you kill me,

27
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,080
you will,

28
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,040
just like in the past,

29
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,960
be like stray dogs,

30
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:18,000
wandering around.

31
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,079
If you act as bandits again,

32
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,720
who will protect your lives?

33
00:02:25,079 --> 00:02:26,280
Furthermore,

34
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,640
though I'm temporarily in trouble,

35
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,120
my Chu family

36
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,900
has received the Emperor's grace

37
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,360
and holds a gold medal granted by him.

38
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,370
As long as I hold the gold medal,

39
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,040
I can enter the palace to see him.

40
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,280
How can those filthy villains

41
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,960
bring me down

42
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,960
just by saying so?

43
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,610
Brother Chaijiu, you are here.

44
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:03,080
Lord Chu.

45
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,360
Now that Brother Chaijiu has left the Ice Well Agency,

46
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:09,420
you're not still thinking of controlling him, are you?

47
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,280
Brother Chaijiu,

48
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:14,440
I'm in a hurry to go back to find my sister-in-law and sister.

49
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:15,160
Are you coming with me

50
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,090
or staying here?

51
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,880
Your sister-in-law and sister are not at home.

52
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,490
But they are in a safe place.

53
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:25,440
You captured his family?

54
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,579
Capital Director.

55
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,720
He will definitely come back to find me.

56
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,120
If you feel bad,

57
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,880
just wait for him here.

58
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,800
Sister-in-law, Sister.

59
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,160
The stove is cold.

60
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,960
Xiaolian is weak and can't leave the house.

61
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,800
Could they really have been taken by Chu Sanniang?

62
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,560
Usually, if I knock with the secret code,

63
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,220
someone will answer the door.

64
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:18,399
It seems Mr. Zhou knows I'm a wanted man,

65
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,839
so he's avoiding me.

66
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,480
I must catch the assassin myself

67
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,920
to prove my innocence.

68
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:31,240
Sir.

69
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,159
I know where the thief is.

70
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,320
Is it her?

71
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,320
Yes.

72
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,360
Daughter.

73
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:56,560
Daughter.

74
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:57,760
How dare you!

75
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,920
How could I possibly

76
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,600
help you solve a case?

77
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,260
If this is successful,

78
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:06,160
I will naturally help you find

79
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:07,920
your long-lost daughter.

80
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,360
Search carefully!

81
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:47,140
Keep your eyes peeled.

82
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,080
Officers,

83
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,250
it's just ahead.

84
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,680
You few,

85
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,480
go over there.

86
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,600
Look carefully!

87
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,240
Nothing here.

88
00:06:54,159 --> 00:06:55,440
Nothing here either.

89
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,220
Nothing found.

90
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,320
Bastard!

91
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,120
How dare you mess with me!

92
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,880
They were just there.

93
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,440
Look, the fire isn't even out yet.

94
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,920
If you make another false report,

95
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,120
I'll take your miserable life!

96
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:16,720
Withdraw!

97
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,680
Yes, sir.

98
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,800
How dare you report to the authorities!

99
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,760
You dared to take my sister-in-law and sister!

100
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,320
Brother Meng,

101
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:36,920
calm down.

102
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:37,560
Calm down.

103
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,440
She took my sister-in-law and sister.

104
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,240
I can't calm down!

105
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:39,560
Calm down.

106
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,040
Where are my sister-in-law and sister?

107
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:41,720
Where on earth are they?

108
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,780
If you want to know,

109
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,520
then do something for me.

110
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,560
Do what?

111
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:49,480
I will personally catch those

112
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:52,480
Liangshan assassins who entered Wuyou City with you.

113
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:53,200
You

114
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:53,840
lead

115
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:54,400
the way.

116
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:08,640
Brother Chaijiu.

117
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,050
This is Luoshifang.

118
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,400
Luoshifang again.

119
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,680
They just left.

120
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:10,560
Look.
